window.bookSummaryJSON = "<b>DRAGONS LIKE YOU'VE NEVER SEEN . . .</b><br><br>Dragons don't need doctors.<br><br>We are immortal, invincible, unbreakable.<br><br>So how do I get close to that beautiful doctor I know is my fated mate?<br><br>Well, I got a plan . . .<br><br>And soon I'll have what's mine.<br><br>After all, that's what fate means, right?<br><br><i>Drama and madness, fire and brimstone, action and adventure.<br><br>Sweetness with a touch of darkness.<br><br>No cheating. No cliffhangers. And a guaranteed happy ending.<br><br>This is dragon-love, Annabelle Winters style.</i>"; 
